    {
      "id": "nA1",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": {
        "x": -90,
        "y": -60
      },
      "style": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 350
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Note",
        "id": "nA1",
        "params": {
          "text": "Créer une nouvelle colonne :\n\ndf['nouvelle'] = df['a'] + df['b']\ndf['ratio']    = df['a'] / df['b']\ndf.assign(col=lambda x: x['a']*2)\n\nTransformer avec apply :\n\ndf['col'] = df['col'].apply(f)\ndf['col'] = df['col'].map({'a':1, 'b':2})\n\nArrondir / caster :\ndf['col'].round(2)\ndf['col'].astype(int)",
          "bg_color": "#dbeafe",
          "text_color": "#1e40af"
        }
      },
      "width": 560,
      "height": 350,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nA2",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": {
        "x": 500,
        "y": -60
      },
      "style": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 350
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Note",
        "id": "nA2",
        "params": {
          "text": "Normalisation (indispensable pour ML) :\n\nMin-Max (0 → 1) :\nx_norm = (x - x.min()) / (x.max() - x.min())\n\nZ-score (mean=0, std=1) :\nx_std  = (x - x.mean()) / x.std()\n\nPourquoi normaliser ?\n• KNN, SVM sensibles à l'échelle\n• Gradient descent converge plus vite\n• Comparaison équitable entre colonnes",
          "bg_color": "#1e293b",
          "text_color": "#94a3b8"
        }
      },
      "width": 560,
      "height": 350,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nA3",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1090,
        "y": -60
      },
      "style": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 350
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Note",
        "id": "nA3",
        "params": {
          "text": "Encodage des catégories :\n\nLabel encoding (ordinal) :\ndf['col'] = df['col'].astype('category').cat.codes\n\nOne-Hot encoding :\npd.get_dummies(df, columns=['col'])\n\nDiscrétisation continue → catégorie :\npd.cut(df['age'], bins=[0,18,65,120],\n       labels=['jeune','adulte','senior'])\n\n→ Attention aux fuites de données !",
          "bg_color": "#ffe4e6",
          "text_color": "#9f1239"
        }
      },
      "width": 560,
      "height": 350,
      "selected": false
    },
